@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Micro Input navigation
+
+Owns the private Unix socket and one renderer capability. It creates no task state. Explicit scoped configuration enables the bridge; default startup does nothing. Renderer replacement, cancellation and window closure revoke in-flight requests and remove socket/grant files. An occupied socket is never removed or taken over.
