+# Micro Input navigation
+
+Owns exact navigation admission within the existing window. It reads the scoped Host controller metadata and then selects an existing tab and task in one synchronous turn. Source generations are pinned on first list; later replacement stays stale until a new renderer registration. Selected addresses come from the actual tab/session stores. No fallback, transcript read, search or text command is permitted.
